---
import Layout from '../../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Sidebar from '../../../components/Sidebar.astro';
---

<Layout title="Negotiation" lang="en" activePage="negotiation" altLangHref="/onderhandeling/">
  <div class="page-intro">
    <h1>Negotiation</h1>
    <div class="intro-images">
      <img src="/images/product-placement.jpg" alt="Negotiation" />
      <img src="/images/bakkerijproducten-netwerk.jpg" alt="Network" />
      <img src="/images/heuft-ovens.jpg" alt="Heuft ovens" />
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="content-area">
    <main class="main-content entry anim-up">
      <div class="breadcrumbs">
        <a href="/en/">Home</a><span class="sep">/</span><span>Negotiation</span>
      </div>

      <div class="colored-box">
        <p style="text-align:justify;">Negotiation is an art. In every business environment, negotiation skills are essential for success. Whether it concerns the purchase of raw materials, the sale of your products, closing contracts with suppliers or discussing employment agreements — the right negotiation technique can make the difference between a good and an excellent deal.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="divider"></div>

      <h5>PINSO SUPPORTS YOU IN COMPLEX NEGOTIATIONS</h5>
      <img src="/images/product-placement.jpg" alt="Negotiation" class="shadow-img" style="float:right; margin:0 0 10px 14px; width:230px; height:170px; object-fit:cover; border-radius:2px;" />
      <p style="text-align:justify;">With years of experience in various sectors — from the food industry to the textile sector — Pinso has the knowledge and expertise to support you in complex negotiations. We help you strengthen your position, clearly formulate your objectives and achieve the best results.</p>
      <div style="clear:both;"></div>

      <div class="divider"></div>

      <h5>OUR APPROACH</h5>
      <div style="display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; gap:16px; margin:12px 0;">
        <div class="colored-box">
          <h6 style="font-family:'Philosopher',serif; font-size:12px; color:#1a365d; text-transform:uppercase; margin:0 0 8px;">Preparation</h6>
          <p style="font-size:12px;">A thorough preparation is the basis of every successful negotiation. We analyze your situation, identify your strong points and help you develop a clear strategy.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="colored-box">
          <h6 style="font-family:'Philosopher',serif; font-size:12px; color:#1a365d; text-transform:uppercase; margin:0 0 8px;">Execution</h6>
          <p style="font-size:12px;">During the negotiation itself, Pinso supports you with advice and support. We help you strike the right tone and reach win-win solutions that are acceptable to both parties.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="divider"></div>

      <h5>SECTORS WHERE WE HAVE EXPERIENCE</h5>
      <ul class="fancy-list">
        <li>Bakery and food industry</li>
        <li>Textile sector and fashion</li>
        <li>Technology and production</li>
        <li>Retail and distribution</li>
        <li>Real estate and storage</li>
        <li>International trade and export</li>
      </ul>
    </main>

    <Sidebar lang="en" activePage="negotiation" side="left" showLogo={true} />
  </div>
</Layout>
